{"success":true,"data":{"name":"LEGO® MARVEL's Avengers","short_description":"Мстители, собирайтесь! В популярной серии видеоигр LEGO® Marvel вышла новая захватывающая игра о приключениях супергероев.","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Мстители, собирайтесь! В популярной серии видеоигр LEGO® Marvel вышла новая динамичная игра о приключениях супергероев. Присоединитесь к команде Мстителей LEGO® Marvel в этой игре с персонажами и сюжетами из фильмов и других художественных произведений. Играйте за величайших супергероев, которым предстоит спасти мир.</p>","genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Экшены"},{"id":"25","description":"Приключенческие игры"}],"developers":["Traveller's Tales","TT Games","Feral Interactive (Mac)"],"publishers":["Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment","Feral Interactive (Mac)"],"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"26 янв. 2016 г."},"background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/405310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1780599434","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/405310/ss_3d0178f72ecbbbcdba2bdf5b8ff011ec92c220eb.600x338.jpg?t=1780599434","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/405310/ss_3d0178f72ecbbbcdba2bdf5b8ff011ec92c220eb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780599434"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/405310/ss_4277fa5a56d9f46e38fbc217c37b351d7148df01.600x338.jpg?t=1780599434","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/405310/ss_4277fa5a56d9f46e38fbc217c37b351d7148df01.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780599434"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/405310/ss_d524e3eec792bab5717e65b798eefbbbc6bfe0c2.600x338.jpg?t=1780599434","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/405310/ss_d524e3eec792bab5717e65b798eefbbbc6bfe0c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=17805